949
00:46:37.440 --> 00:46:43.580
And once again, we see Dwight like rocking out, doing air guitar to heavy metal, like punching

950
00:46:43.580 --> 00:46:45.880
the seat to get ready.

951
00:46:46.620 --> 00:46:47.020
Yes.

952
00:46:47.480 --> 00:46:47.880
Yeah.

953
00:46:48.080 --> 00:46:50.380
This is their, this is his routine, I guess.

